  title="Terms & Conditions | Shengyuan Peptide"
  description="Terms and conditions for purchasing research peptides from Shandong Shengyuan Peptide Technology Co., Ltd.: orders, pricing, payment, quality terms, liability, and governing law."
>
  <div class="wrap article-shell">
    <div class="article-header">
      <h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
      <p class="lede">Last updated: October 2026</p>
    </div>
    <article>
      <h2>1. Business Entity and Contact</h2>
      <p>
        These terms are issued by <strong>Shandong Shengyuan Peptide Technology Co., Ltd.</strong>, a
        peptide CDMO based in Shandong Province, China, operating shengyuanpeptides.com as a B2B
        sourcing and manufacturing platform for research peptides.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:aaron@shengyuanpeptides.com">aaron@shengyuanpeptides.com</a></li>
        <li><strong>WhatsApp:</strong> +64 2102668969</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. Scope and Acceptance</h2>
      <p>
        These terms govern all use of this website and all purchases of products through it or by
